flowchart TB
  RM[Same release manifest + host artifact]
  RM --> API[API role]
  RM --> WORKER[Worker role]
  RM --> ALL[Local all role]
  API --> HTTP[Business HTTP endpoints]
  API --> CLIENT[Hangfire client]
  WORKER --> SERVER[Hangfire server]
  WORKER --> DISP[Dispatcher capability - E3]
  WORKER --> CONS[Consumer capability - E3/E4]
  WORKER --> SCHED[Recurring authority]
  ALL --> HTTP
  ALL --> SERVER
  API -. no business-version selection .-> MODS[All five modules]
  WORKER -. no business HTTP .-> MODS
